{"id":"depois","lemma":"depois","pos":"adv","rank":103,"glosses":["later (afterwards in time)","besides; after all","immediately beyond, just after"],"ipa":"/deˈpojs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-depois.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-depois.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Que aconteceu depois?","en":"What happened after that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/843593","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to happen","l":"acontecer"},null]},{"text":"Te vejo depois.","en":"See you later.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to see","l":"ver"},null]},{"text":"Você quer pagar agora ou depois?","en":"Do you want to pay now or later?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to give [someone] money…"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"or"},null]},{"text":"Eu quero fazer isso depois.","en":"I want to do this later.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/535641","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to create"},{"g":"that"},null]},{"text":"Você sabe o que acontece depois?","en":"Do you know what happens next?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be aware, to know","l":"saber"},null,null,{"g":"to happen","l":"acontecer"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"what"]]}]}